OL,3,GNEWSAFears Mam Tor red routes could
OL,4,Adrive away visitors
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe introduction of Derbyshire's first
OL,7,Fred routes at "inconsiderate parking"
OL,8,Fhotspots in the Peak District has left
OL,9,Fnearby villagers divided
OL,11,FDerbyshire County Council installed the
OL,12,Fmarkings in May after long-standing
OL,13,Fproblems with parking from visitors to
OL,14,Fthe national park - from congestion to
OL,15,Fblocked driveways to human excrement to
OL,16,Ftoppled dry stone walls.
OL,18,FSome 161 fines have since been issued
OL,19,Fto drivers who have parked on the
OL,20,Fdouble-red lines in the Castleton and
OL,21,FMam Tor area, bringing in more than
OL,22,F#4,500 from penalty charge notices.
